### Health
GET http://localhost:7000/api/health

### Signup
POST http://localhost:7000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abhishek",
  "email": "abhishek@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:7000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abhishek@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Events
GET http://localhost:7000/api/events

### Search
GET http://localhost:7000/api/events?search=hackathon&page=1&limit=10

### Create Event
POST http://localhost:7000/api/events
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "CodeChef Hackathon",
  "description": "A development and competitive programming event.",
  "location": "ABES Engineering College",
  "date": "2026-12-20T10:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 100,
  "category": "Technology"
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:7000/api/registrations/events/EVENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### My Registrations
GET http://localhost:7000/api/registrations/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
